readme.text:
- Nested `edit`/`write` rows become standard file cards: title, workspace-relative path,
  decoded input size, `+added -removed`;
- expanding renders the shipped `DiffBlock`: language label, wrap/copy actions, path line,
  colored additions and deletions, `⋯ N more lines` folding;
- failed calls render no diff: the error's first line in the summary, raw output expanded
  (same as the stock row);
- root calls look byte-for-byte identical to the shipped row, because the whole row is a
  faithful re-implementation.
